<title>USA: Greater Community Bancorp revises 1996 EPS.</title>
<headline>Greater Community Bancorp revises 1996 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>TOTOWA, N.J. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greater Community Bancorp said Wednesday it revised its per share earnings previously reported on January 22, 1997 for the fiscal year ended Dec. 31, 1996 to  $1.11 from $0.97.</p>
<p>The company did not change its earnings for the fiscal year ended Dec. 31, 1996 of $2,337,000. In addition, the company's previously announced net earnings and earnings per share for the quarter ended March 31, 1997, remain unchanged.</p>
